  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\integral.domain]\nDeclares: D ::= (X, +, *, 0, 1) is \\(commutative)::ring via (X, +, *, 0, 1)\nsatisfies:\n. 0 != 1\n. forAll: a, b \"in\" D\n  then:\n  . if: a * b = 0\n    then:\n    . anyOf:\n      . a = 0\n      . b = 0\nDocumented:\n. called: \"integral domain\"\n. description: \"A nontrivial commutative ring without zero divisors.\"\nId: \"be91bf4c-366f-430f-bff8-6f9c7225736d\"",
